<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;">Hurry, offer ends 15 February 2021</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><br></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2031794577/QBR+email+header.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2035884624/qantas_homepage_image_QBR_Triple-Points+680x+185.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="680"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table class="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Earn triple Qantas Points on eligible flights within Australia</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Hi &lt; Name &gt;,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Thanks for your time on the phone.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">For a limited time, Qantas Business Rewards members can book any&nbsp;<b>eligible domestic flight</b>&nbsp;within Australia and receive&nbsp;<b>triple Qantas Points</b>* for their business.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">To take advantage of this offer, Qantas Business Rewards members must register and book an eligible flight between&nbsp;<b>9 February 2021 and 15 February 2021</b>, for travel up until 31 December 2021.*</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">When making a booking for a Qantas Business Rewards member, don't forget to add the business' ABN and the traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number. That way, these Qantas Business Rewards members will earn triple Qantas Points for their business^, as well as the usual Qantas Points and Status Credits for the traveller+.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/QBAS042.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 16px; height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/QBAS042.html" target="_blank" alt="Register now" title="Register now" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; line-height: 16px; font-family: Ciutadella, Arial, Helvetica !important;">Register now</a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/QBAS042.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 40px; height: 42px; max-width: 600px; border: 0px; width: 600px;"><table align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 600px; border: 0px; width: 600px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 22px 0px 0px; height: 45px; border: 0px;"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 40px; border: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertica